LUT = LUT1..LUT6 used as logic; LUTRAM = distributed RAM + SRL; BRAM36 counts
RAMB36 as 1 and RAMB18 as 0.5. Yosys does not place or route, so these are
pre-implementation estimates (Vivado will typically optimise further).
